gmeow:gtsSegmentHeadKey
    a owl:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:KeyAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/gts> ;
    rdfs:label "a GTS segment is keyed by its chain head"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts that a gmeow:GTSSegment is identified by its gmeow:gtsHeadId: the chain head is a BLAKE3 content-id committing transitively to the segment's entire frame history, so two distinct segments sharing a head would be a full-history BLAKE3 collision — impossible by construction. The head therefore uniquely identifies its segment (content-addressing IS the identity), and the native DL consistency gate forces two segments asserted distinct yet sharing a head into owl:Nothing. Stated as a key (the logic: analogue of owl:hasKey, OWL 2 DL) rather than an inverse-functional characteristic, which on the datatype property gmeow:gtsHeadId would be OWL 2 Full."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:keyClass gmeow:GTSSegment ;
    logic:keyProperty gmeow:gtsHeadId ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:gtsHeadId ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce this record's integrity condition over gmeow:GTSSegment; the record is the canonical carrier the gate joins."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when gmeow:GTSSegment no longer bears the condition — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read the record's own logic: fields together: they name gmeow:GTSSegment and the condition asserted over it, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching axiom from them."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:GTSSegment and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:GTSSegment (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:gtsSegmentHeadKey logic:characterizes gmeow:GTSSegment ."@x-gmeow-english ;
